Android's chat runs on libsignal-net (Signal-Android `LibSignalChatConnection.kt:68`), whose
environments are `STAGING(0)` and `PRODUCTION(1)` only (`Network.java:25`), roots compiled in
(`rust/net/src/certs.rs:10`, `:12`). The local override is Node's only (`net.rs:152`
`#[bridge_fn(jni = false, ffi = false)]`; `node/ts/net.ts:130` `localTestServer: true`).

